  :adr/authoritative_for
  ["cloud-itonami .cljc actors (langgraph-clj StateGraph + LLM advisor +
    independent Governor + atom/defrecord-backed store) are confirmed
    incompatible with the kotoba/kototama/kotoba-lang-compiler .kotoba
    execution stack, per 2 independent investigations reaching the same
    conclusion"
   "the only approved pattern for using .kotoba inside cloud-itonami is
    narrow-slice porting (hand-rewrite a small pure decision function, NOT
    the whole actor) -- ADR-2607072600's isic-6492 affordability example is
    the sole proven precedent"
   "kotoba wasm emit's ACTUAL accepted operator set (not the documented
    aspirational subset) is recorded here as the constraint any future
    porting attempt must target"
   "no wholesale .kotoba migration for cloud-itonami's ~900 blueprint entries"]
